      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The actual problem is that Steam's bool actions for \"jump\" and \"mic\" are both recognized as the 'Jump' axis in Udon.\n\nPreviously, Button A in right hand was able to read as axis \"Fire2\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
